  "findings": [
    "The abstract SignType lemma handles all three constructors for each of a,b,tau by constructor cases and simplification. The hypotheses exclude every zero-sign branch. For the remaining +/-1 values, equal attachment signs are either both tau (loop) or both -tau (printed same-sign case); unequal attachment signs are exactly the mixed case. The displayed iff is the full complement of the loop conjunction, not merely a sufficient condition.",
